# Product Vision

This repo is a **generic shop order platform** (not a single hard-coded restaurant brand).

## Surfaces
- **Now:** Staff POS + admin (Spring Boot API + Angular desktop SPA)
- **Later:** Customer website + tablet/phone app (Android/iOS via Capacitor) — separate shells, do not reuse admin/POS UI

## Core product rules
- Multi-shop ready: data is scoped by `shop_id` (even if one shop is seeded today)
- Features in scope long-term: order taking, delivery status, customer accounts, loyalty points, completion notify
- Keep POS simple, fast, and touch-friendly — no chrome clutter on order-taking
- Do not invent microservices or full Clean Architecture rewrites unless asked

## Commits
- Do not create git commits unless the user explicitly asks
